    "active": true,
    "description": "<p>A soaring leap, a blaze of motion, this form embodies rebirth through action. You rise above your foes, crashing down with both elegance and fury.</p>\n<p>You leap into battle with furious grace. Whilst in this form, you gain the following modifiers:</p>\n<ul><li>Gain +2 bonus per Int mod to Climb (Climbing) and Jump (Athletics) checks.</li><li>When you Jump into melee, add +Int mod to your first attack’s damage.</li></ul>\n<p><em>Automated:</em> press Combat Form's Use to enter it (1 AP, a stance). +2 per Int to Climbing checks and to High Jump and Long Jump; +Int damage is offered as a tick on your first attack after jumping into melee. All its modifiers are class bonuses.</p>",
